# Profesor Brasa. The camera cuts to him; his challenge, the fight (trainer brasa: Cindermeer 42, Cindibex 40, Blazibex 42, Pyromeer 47); a win = his speech, the Medalla Brasa (flag 86, the trainer card's
# 7th badge, a flame), what it is, then Disc 10 (Inferno = Inferno; a full bag keeps brasa_disc clear and he hands it over the next time you talk to him). A loss is the blackout. Afterwards a last line.
@script brasa npc
    jf badge_brasa after
    npc_face_hero brasa
    cam_npc brasa
    say gym.brasa.pre
    battle brasa 0
    jv 0 1 won
    blackout
    end
  won:
    say gym.brasa.win
    setf badge_brasa
    say gym.brasa.badge
    say gym.brasa.about
    call brasa_gift
    cam_hero
    end
  after:
    npc_face_hero brasa
    cam_npc brasa
    jf brasa_disc said
    call brasa_gift
    cam_hero
    end
  said:
    say gym.brasa.after
    cam_hero
@end
@script brasa_gift called
    say gym.brasa.disc
    give_item disc_10 1
    jv 0 0 full
    item_var 0 disc_10
    say gl.gift
    setf brasa_disc
    say gym.brasa.disc_about
    end
  full:
    say gl.found.full
@end
